## 6. Security Checklist

- [ ] Razorpay `key_secret` never in client-side code
- [ ] Webhook signature verified on every webhook call
- [ ] Supabase RLS enabled on all tables
- [ ] Admin routes protected by Supabase Auth
- [ ] `.env.local` in `.gitignore`
- [ ] No donor PII exposed in client-side logs
- [ ] HTTPS enforced in production
- [ ] CORS restricted to own domain in production
- [ ] CSP headers configured
- [ ] No sensitive data in URL parameters

